<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Barrick EPS view lowered.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Barrick EPS view lowered.</headline>
<text>
<p>--EVEREN Securities Inc said Wednesday it lowered its EPS estimates on Barrick Gold Corp to account for the company's recent acquisition and development activities.</p>
<p>--It lowered its EPS projection to $0.74 from $0.82 for 1996, noting there are more shares outstanding. Its estimate went to $0.73 from $0.85 for 1997 and to $0.84 from $1.02 for 1998.</p>
<p>--Barrick was trading at 26-5/8.</p>
<p>	   -- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
</text>
